# Ops prod (el-astro)

Lire `CURSOR.md` avant tout deploy ou purge cache.

## Never

- Never `rm -rf /var/cache/nginx` or delete zone dirs (`el-astro-prod`, etc.).
- Never purge with anything wider than `find <zone> -type f -delete`.
- Never restart `el-astro-web` while `astro build` is running or after a failed build.
- Never improvise `npm run build && systemctl restart … && rm -rf …/cache`.

## Deploy

Use only:

```bash
./scripts/deploy.sh          # all
./scripts/deploy.sh web      # front
./scripts/deploy.sh api      # API / env
```

Atomic build (`dist.next` → swap → restart → healthcheck) is mandatory.

## After changes

- Verify `curl -sI http://127.0.0.1:4322/` → 200 and body non-empty.
- Verify `curl -sS http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/health`.
- Check `journalctl -u el-astro-web -n 20` for `ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND`.
